sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant FE as BeamShare page
    participant WS as WS /beamshare/server
    participant API as /api/beamshare/files/:id/*
    participant Meta as FileMetadata
    participant FS as Uploads

    User->>FE: Open /beamshare (auth required)
    FE->>WS: Connect (peer_id,webrtc_supported)
    WS-->>FE: rtcConfig + assigned displayName
    FE->>WS: join-ip-room
    WS-->>FE: peers list; relays signaling between peers
    FE->>API: GET metadata for owned file
    API->>Meta: getFileMetadataForUser
    API->>FS: Check size vs plan limit
    API-->>FE: Metadata or 413 if too large
    FE->>API: GET /download/{id}
    API->>FS: Stream file
